# .gitignore para proyecto .NET / ASP.NET Core
# Generado para ignorar artefactos comunes de compilación, IDEs y macOS

## Build / outputs
/bin/
/obj/
**/bin/
**/obj/

## User-specific files
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Visual Studio cache/options
.vs/
/.vscode/

## Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## NuGet
# NuGet packages
*.nupkg
# The packages folder can be ignored because of PackageReference
packages/

## Visual Studio publish
*.Publish.xml
publish/
*.pubxml
*.publishproj

## dotnet tools
*.dotnet/tools

## EF Core Migrations / model snapshots (si quieres mantenerlos en repo, no ignores)
# Migrations are often checked into source control. No ignorar por defecto.

## user secrets and local configuration
# Ignorar secretos locales y archivos de desarrollo con datos sensibles
secrets.json
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.*.Local.json

## Logs
*.log
logs/

## Debugging
*.vspscc
*.dbmdl
*.pdb

## Test results
TestResults/
*.trx
coverage/

## Publish output
publish/
*.zip

## Rider/IntelliJ
/.idea
*.iml

## macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

## Linux
*~

## Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

## Certificates
*.pfx
*.p12

## Package manager folders
node_modules/

## Others
*.vsix
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sql

# Allow this repo to keep an example of config if you want
!appsettings.json
